            <title>[LU-17698] Debian 12: lustre-*-dbgsym_$${VER}_*.ddeb: No such file or directory</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-17698</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;On Debian 12, DBGSYM_PACKAGE_TYPE is defined the same as DEFAULT_PACKAGE_TYPE, which is 'deb' instead of 'ddeb' in Dh_Lib.pm.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So, the suffix of the dbgsym debug symbol packages is '.deb', and the changes in &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/53378" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/53378&lt;/a&gt; ("&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-17347" title="make debs is ignoring some output files (ddeb)" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-17347"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-17347&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; debs: also move .ddeb files into debs/") will be causing the following build failure:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;mv: cannot stat '../lustre-*-dbgsym_2.15.61-194-g5cda4a3-1_*.ddeb': No such file or directory
make: *** [autoMakefile:1318: debs] Error 1
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
